  "description": "\"What is your wish? I’ll weave a dream of fortune just for you!\"Chilbok, a genius dream weaver who grants wishes in exchange for dreams. After ten years of rigorous training under his master, his ambition to enter the imperial palace shatters when he fails the crucial exam.Before despair takes hold, a scarred and enigmatic figure appears before him. A royal-born mad man, scarred by life, Grand Prince Yeonmyeong.This is the story of those chasing faintly shining dreams and seeking hidden stars amidst the clouds.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=834733), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11949263)",
